Лудо Такси · мапи на Скопје
Copyright © 2026 Бојан Божиновски (Bojan Bozinovski). All rights reserved.

This covers the website and game: the source code (app.js, fun.js, index.html, style.css,
build.py, server.py, make_zip.py, the tools/ folder), the sheet layout (layout*.js), the logo and
icon, the texts, and the games and extras built on top of the maps (Каде, шефе?, the taximeter,
Погоди ја населбата, night shift and the rest).

The repository is public so the site can be served with GitHub Pages and so people can read the
code. That does not grant a licence: copying, modifying, redistributing or reusing the code, the
design or the game, in whole or in part, needs written permission from the author.
Contact: https://www.linkedin.com/in/bojanb/

The hand-drawn maps (the scans in input/ and sheets/) are the work of the Skopje taxi driver who
signed them „МБ“ and remain theirs; they are not covered by the copyright above.

The street map comes from OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
Open Database License (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
